"modal.title": "Itangazo",
"modal.text": "Bashyitsi bacu b'icyubahiro! Buri mwambaro uri muri iri gallery ni umusaruro w'amasaha menshi y'akazi. Imyambaro yakozwe n'uwashinze urubuga irinzwe n'uburenganzira bw'umuhanzi: kuyireba biremewe, ariko kuyimanura, kuyikoporora no kuyikoresha mu bucuruzi bisaba kubanza kumvikana. Ibindi bikoresho ni iby'ababikoze bavuzwe mu bisobanuro, kandi bikoreshwa hakurikijwe amabwiriza y'impushya zabo. Murakoze ku bwumvikane n'ubunyangamugayo! Mwibuke ko iyi ari serivisi ya Minecraft itari iy'umwimerere. Ntabwo yemejwe na Mojang cyangwa Microsoft kandi ntaho ihuriye na byo. Ba nyir'urubuga ni bo barubazwa, atari Mojang cyangwa Microsoft.",
